<title>USA: FutureNet sees yr loss of $0.27 per shr.</title>
<headline>FutureNet sees yr loss of $0.27 per shr.</headline>
<dateline>VALENCIA, Calif. 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>FutureNet Online Inc said Friday that it expects to report a loss of about $2 million, or $0.27 per share, on revenues of about $4 million for the year ended December 31.</p>
<p>For the five months ended May 31, the company said it expects to report a loss of about $875,000, or $0.07 per share, on revenues of about $9.0 million.</p>
<p>FutureNet is a network marketing company.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
